<title>PAKISTAN: Abbott Lab Pakistan net falls.</title>
<headline>Abbott Lab Pakistan net falls.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended November 30, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		   1,612 vs 1,463</p>
<p>    Profit before tax     198 vs   256</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	129 vs   168</p>
<p>    Interim dividend   15 pct vs 15 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>    Final dividend     10 pct vs 15 pct</p>
<p>    Bonus stocks	 10 pct vs 20 pct (ten-for-100)</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Abbott Laboratories (Pakistan) Ltd . Book closure April 19 to May 18. Ex-dividend and ex-bonus stocks date April 18. AGM on May 18.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
